🧪 ACTUAL EXAM-TYPE QUESTIONS (IMPORTANT)
These are how questions are framed:
🔹 Example 1 (Very Common)
“Given an array, find subarray with sum = K”
Mistake people do:
don’t use hashmap → TLE or wrong
🔹 Example 2
“Find longest substring without repeating characters”
Mistake:
brute force instead of sliding window
🔹 Example 3
“Check if string is palindrome ignoring special chars”
Mistake:
not handling edge cases
🔹 Example 4
“Booking system / seat allocation logic”
Mistake:
poor condition handling
🔹 Example 5
“Find duplicates / frequency-based logic”
Mistake:
not using hashmap properly
